==== hyperbricks yaml {!{image}} ====
image:
  - type: image
  - attributes:
      loading: lazy
  - enclose: <div id="#gallery">|</div>
  - src: hyperbricks-test-files/assets/cute_cat.jpg
  - width: "100"
==== explainer ====
Use the pipe symbol | to enclose the ````<IMG>```` tag.
==== expected json ====
{
  "Alt": "",
  "Class": "",
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<IMAGE>",
  "Enclose": "<div id=\"#gallery\">|</div>",
  "ExtraAttributes": {
    "loading": "lazy"
  },
  "Height": 0,
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "Id": "",
  "IsStatic": false,
  "Loading": "",
  "MetaDocDescription": "",
  "Quality": 0,
  "Src": "hyperbricks-test-files/assets/cute_cat.jpg",
  "Title": "",
  "Width": 100
}

==== expected output ====
<div id="#gallery"><img src="static/images/cute_cat_w100_h100.jpg" width="100" height="100" loading="lazy" /></div> 
